          "note_type_name": "comment",
          "free_text": "DQM review: left/right mapping primers are provisionally mapped to forward/reverse without reversing the source sequences. Confirm the source orientation convention."
        },
        {
          "internal": false,
          "note_type_name": "comment",
          "free_text": "Source Method: Orfeome"
